HeliBoard adapts only Ramblr's consent-based AudioRecord lifecycle, bounded
PCM file buffering, WAV handoff, and recording state-machine concepts. The
adapted source is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE in this
directory for the complete terms.

This application does not include Ramblr's AccessibilityService, overlay,
model downloader, sherpa-onnx, llama.cpp, cloud provider SDKs, or a second
input method. HeliBoard uses Android's on-device SpeechRecognizer where the
platform supplies one, and offers an explicit user-triggered Gemini upload
only after recording and review.
